{"timestamp": 1783618567.336801, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 8, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I found Frank\u2019s body in electrical and reported immediately. My route was security -> weapons -> back through security -> electrical. The only person I saw this round was Alice in weapons around ticks 4 and 5. I didn\u2019t see anyone in electrical before finding the body, and I didn\u2019t see anyone running away."}}
{"timestamp": 1783618573.136014, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 8, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "My route was navigation -> security -> weapons. I saw Charlie in weapons at ticks 4 and 5, so I can confirm that part of their story. I didn\u2019t see Frank at all this round, and I didn\u2019t go into electrical, so I can\u2019t confirm where or when the kill happened. Charlie being in weapons with me briefly doesn\u2019t clear them completely, but it does match what they said. I\u2019d like to hear where Bob, Diana, and Eve were."}}
{"timestamp": 1783618579.2742531, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 8, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I was upper_engine -> oxygen this round and I haven\u2019t seen anyone at all, so I can\u2019t directly place anyone near electrical or Frank. I didn\u2019t see Frank either.\n\nSo far Charlie and Alice match each other for weapons around ticks 4-5, but that doesn\u2019t fully clear Charlie since they later went to electrical and found the body. We really need Bob and Diana\u2019s routes now, especially whether either of them were near electrical/security or saw Frank alive."}}
{"timestamp": 1783618586.450343, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 8, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I started in medbay and went to upper_engine. I didn\u2019t see anyone the whole round, and I never went near electrical/security, so I can\u2019t confirm anything about the body or Frank\u2019s last location.\n\nFrom what we have: Alice and Charlie confirm seeing each other in weapons around ticks 4-5, which makes both of their routes at least partly consistent. Charlie still could\u2019ve found the body after, but there\u2019s no direct contradiction yet. Eve was off in upper_engine/oxygen and also saw nobody, same as me basically.\n\nThe biggest missing piece is Bob\u2019s route. If Bob was anywhere near electrical/security, that matters a lot. Right now I don\u2019t think I have enough to hard accuse Charlie just for reporting, but I want to hear Bob before deciding whether this is a skip or if someone\u2019s story doesn\u2019t fit."}}
{"timestamp": 1783618620.2891772, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 8, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I was cafeteria into medbay and stayed on the medbay task for most of the round. I didn\u2019t see anyone there \u2014 Diana saying she started medbay and left for upper_engine probably means she left before I got in, because I never crossed paths with her.\n\nI never went electrical or security, and I didn\u2019t see Frank alive at all. So I can\u2019t help with the exact timing. Right now the only hard info is Alice and Charlie confirming each other in weapons around ticks 4-5, then Charlie later reports in electrical. That doesn\u2019t make Charlie guilty by itself, but it also doesn\u2019t fully clear them since they\u2019re the one who found it.\n\nI don\u2019t think we have enough for a confident vote unless someone\u2019s route contradicts, so I\u2019m leaning skip, but I\u2019d keep an eye on Charlie just because reporter/body location is our only real lead."}}
{"timestamp": 1783618629.6565928, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 8, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I\u2019ll repeat my info clearly: I went security \u2192 weapons, saw Alice in weapons at ticks 4 and 5, then I went back through security into electrical and found Frank\u2019s body there. I reported immediately. I didn\u2019t see anyone leaving electrical or security, and I didn\u2019t see Frank alive this round.\n\nAlice confirms seeing me in weapons, so at least that part lines up. Since everyone else is saying they were away and saw nobody, we don\u2019t really have a direct suspect or contradiction. I don\u2019t think \u201cCharlie reported\u201d is enough to vote me \u2014 I found the body and called it in.\n\nRight now I\u2019m leaning skip unless someone has stronger timing info, but I agree we should watch routes next round, especially around electrical/security."}}
{"timestamp": 1783618639.291271, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 8, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I don\u2019t have anything new beyond confirming Charlie was definitely in weapons with me at ticks 4 and 5. I never went electrical and didn\u2019t see Frank at all, so I can\u2019t place the kill.\n\nAfter hearing everyone, there\u2019s no clear contradiction: Bob/Diana/Eve all claim routes away from electrical, and Charlie\u2019s route is the only one that puts someone near the body. That makes Charlie the only \u201copportunity\u201d on paper, but it\u2019s also just because they reported it, and I don\u2019t think that alone is enough to eject.\n\nI\u2019m leaning skip here, but next round I think we should avoid being alone, especially near electrical/security, and pay close attention to who pairs up with who."}}
{"timestamp": 1783618647.391922, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 8, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I don\u2019t have new hard info \u2014 my route was upper_engine to oxygen, and I didn\u2019t see anyone the whole round. I never went near electrical/security, and I didn\u2019t see Frank alive.\n\nBased on everyone\u2019s stories, the only confirmed overlap is Alice and Charlie in weapons around ticks 4-5. Charlie is the only person placed near electrical, but that\u2019s because they reported the body, and nobody saw anyone fleeing or contradicts their route. Bob/Diana/me all claim away from the body with no witnesses, so there isn\u2019t enough to pin it on anyone.\n\nI\u2019m leaning skip here. Next round we should try to pair up and be very clear about routes, because right now the Duck got a kill with basically no witnesses."}}
{"timestamp": 1783618654.812321, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 8, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I don\u2019t have new info beyond my route: I started medbay, then went to upper_engine, and I didn\u2019t see anyone at all. I also never went toward security/electrical, so I can\u2019t place Frank or the killer.\n\nBob saying he went cafeteria into medbay and didn\u2019t see me could fit if I left before he arrived, so that\u2019s not a contradiction by itself. Alice and Charlie still have the only mutual confirmation in weapons at ticks 4-5. Charlie is the only one admitting to being near electrical, but since they reported immediately and nobody saw anyone running, I don\u2019t think that\u2019s enough to vote them out.\n\nI\u2019m leaning skip. Next round I think we should pair up and track who goes near electrical/security, because right now the kill has no witness and no clear contradiction."}}
{"timestamp": 1783618663.782323, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 8, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "Nothing new from me \u2014 my route was cafeteria to medbay, and I stayed there doing the medbay task. I didn\u2019t see Frank at all, and I didn\u2019t cross Diana, so I assume the timing just missed.\n\nI agree there\u2019s no clean contradiction here. Charlie is the only person placed at electrical, but that\u2019s also because they reported, and Alice confirms part of Charlie\u2019s route. I don\u2019t think we should vote on just that.\n\nI\u2019m voting skip, but next round I\u2019ll try to stay paired so we actually have clearer info."}}
