{"timestamp": 1783618986.74604, "event_type": "body_reported", "tick": 24, "data": {"caller": "player_0", "reason": "Alice reported a dead body", "bodies": [{"room": "upper_engine", "victim_name": "Charlie"}]}}
{"timestamp": 1783618986.74672, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 24, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1783618994.875464, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 24, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I reported Charlie\u2019s body in upper_engine. My route was navigation -> storage -> medbay -> electrical -> medbay -> upper_engine. I saw Charlie alive earlier in weapons around ticks 4 and 5. Later I saw Eve in medbay around tick 14 and then in electrical around tick 18. I didn\u2019t see Bob or Diana this round, and I didn\u2019t see anyone actually leaving upper_engine when I found the body. Frank was already dead from the previous meeting."}}
{"timestamp": 1783619001.998102, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 24, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "My route was medbay -> upper_engine -> lower_engine -> storage -> navigation -> security. I was in upper_engine around ticks 11-12 and I saw Charlie alive there with Bob. Important detail: I saw Bob enter upper_engine from lower_engine at tick 11, and then both Bob and Charlie were still in upper_engine at tick 12.\n\nAfter that I left toward lower_engine and continued my route, and I didn\u2019t see Charlie again. I also didn\u2019t see Alice or Eve this round. Based on Alice finding Charlie\u2019s body in upper_engine, Bob was the last person I personally saw with Charlie in that exact room. So Bob definitely needs to explain where he went after tick 12."}}
{"timestamp": 1783619014.970975, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 24, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "My route was storage -> medbay -> electrical -> security. I saw Alice enter medbay from storage at tick 14, and then I saw her again in electrical around tick 18, so that lines up with Alice\u2019s story.\n\nI did not see Bob, Diana, or Charlie at all this round, so I can\u2019t directly confirm what happened in upper_engine. But Diana saying she saw Bob with Charlie in upper_engine at ticks 11-12 is really important, since Charlie\u2019s body was found there later.\n\nRight now Alice\u2019s route is partially confirmed by me, and Diana gave a pretty specific timing. Bob needs to explain exactly where he went after being in upper_engine with Charlie. If he can\u2019t give a clear route or someone can\u2019t vouch for him, I\u2019m leaning Bob."}}
{"timestamp": 1783619044.1850922, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 24, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I get why that sounds bad, but Diana\u2019s leaving out the important part that Charlie was alive when I left too. I was in upper_engine at ticks 11-12, yes. Diana came in from medbay, saw us, then left toward lower_engine. I left after that going upper_engine -> oxygen -> cafeteria -> weapons -> security -> navigation -> storage. I didn\u2019t see Alice or Eve at all, which matches them being more around medbay/electrical.\n\nSo the only confirmed thing is that Diana and I both saw Charlie alive in upper_engine. That doesn\u2019t mean I killed him. Alice found the body way later after going through medbay and electrical, so there\u2019s a timing gap. Diana was also in that room with Charlie, and her whole accusation is basically \u201cI saw Bob there\u201d while admitting she was there too. I\u2019m not saying it\u2019s definitely Diana, but I don\u2019t think this is as simple as \u201clast seen with him = vote Bob.\u201d"}}
{"timestamp": 1783619058.315178, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 24, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "Just to clarify from my side: I found Charlie\u2019s body in upper_engine, and I had not seen Bob or Diana at all this round. Eve can confirm me being in medbay around tick 14 and electrical around tick 18, so I didn\u2019t just appear near upper_engine early.\n\nThe key point for me is that Diana and Bob both agree Bob was in upper_engine with Charlie around ticks 11-12, and they also both agree Diana left first. That means Bob was the last confirmed person alone with Charlie in the room where the body was found.\n\nBob\u2019s route after that is possible, but it\u2019s unconfirmed, and there\u2019s no one vouching for him leaving Charlie alive. Diana\u2019s info is more specific and lines up with the body location. I\u2019m leaning Bob here."}}
{"timestamp": 1783619068.764103, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 24, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "Bob\u2019s right that I was in upper_engine too, but the timing matters: I left while Charlie was still alive and while Bob was still there with him. I went out toward lower_engine and continued storage -> navigation -> security, and I never came back to upper_engine.\n\nThe strongest fact we have is: Charlie\u2019s body was found in upper_engine, and the last confirmed person alone with Charlie there was Bob. Bob\u2019s claimed route after that is totally unconfirmed, and he says he saw nobody through a long route across the map.\n\nAlice is partially vouched by Eve in medbay/electrical, and Eve\u2019s route seems consistent. I know I left first. So from my perspective, Bob has the clearest opportunity and the weakest alibi. I\u2019m voting Bob unless something major changes."}}
{"timestamp": 1783619089.765399, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 24, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I want to be careful because if we vote wrong here it\u2019s really bad, but the stories are lining up pretty strongly against Bob.\n\nMy info is: I was storage -> medbay -> electrical -> security. I saw Alice come into medbay from storage at tick 14, and I saw her again in electrical around tick 18. So Alice being away from upper_engine during the earlier window checks out from my perspective.\n\nI never saw Bob, Diana, or Charlie myself. But both Diana and Bob agree on the important part: Bob was in upper_engine with Charlie at ticks 11-12, Diana left first, and Charlie\u2019s body was later found in that same room. Bob\u2019s claimed route afterward has no witness, and nobody confirms Charlie was alive after Bob left.\n\nCould it be a self-report from Alice? Technically possible, but Eve/Alice sightings make her route more traceable, and the strongest opportunity we have is still Bob being last confirmed alone with Charlie. Unless the last speaker has something major that clears Bob or implicates someone else, I\u2019m voting Bob."}}
{"timestamp": 1783619111.586623, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 24, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I need people to slow down because this is turning into \u201crepeat Bob\u2019s name until it sounds confirmed.\u201d The only *confirmed* fact is that I was in upper_engine with Charlie when he was alive. Diana was also there. She left at tick 12, and I left right after toward oxygen. Charlie was alive when I left.\n\nMy full route after that was upper_engine -> oxygen -> cafeteria -> weapons -> security -> navigation -> storage. I know nobody saw me, but nobody saw Diana for most of her claimed route either except her own word. Diana is using the fact she left first as if that magically clears her, but it doesn\u2019t prove who killed Charlie or when. The body was found later by Alice, and there\u2019s a big timing gap.\n\nAlso, Alice and Eve vouching each other only proves Alice was in medbay/electrical around mid-round, not who killed Charlie in upper_engine or exactly when Charlie died. If we vote wrong here, we\u2019re in a terrible spot.\n\nFrom my perspective Diana is pushing way too hard off one snapshot she saw and ignoring the timing gap completely. I think Diana is the better vote than me here."}}
